 Object.assign(translations.zh,{"FindSpreadsheet snapshot: 19 Oct 2026. Listings shown have a Weidian ID and open on Joyagoo. USD prices are estimates converted from the snapshot at 1 USD = 6.6753 CNY (6 Nov 2026); confirm the current price and availability on Joyagoo. QC photos are not included.":"FindSpreadsheet 快照：2026 年 10 月 19 日。展示的商品均有微店编号，可在 Joyagoo 打开。美元价格以 1 美元 = 6.6753 人民币（2026 年 11 月 6 日）换算，仅供参考；请在 Joyagoo 确认当前价格和库存。快照不包含 QC 照片。","Product, category or item ID":"商品、类别或商品编号","Loading products…":"正在加载商品…","No matching products in this snapshot.":"该快照中没有符合条件的商品。","Unable to load the catalogue. Please try again.":"无法加载商品目录，请重试。","Product not found in this catalogue snapshot.":"该目录快照中未找到商品。","QC photos are not included in this catalogue snapshot. Check your own order on Joyagoo.":"该目录快照不包含 QC 照片，请在 Joyagoo 查看自己的订单。","Weidian item ID:":"微店商品编号：","Not available":"不可用","View source product":"查看来源商品","Categories":"类别","Guides":"指南","How to Buy":"如何购买","FAQ":"常见问题","A considered way to discover products":"用心发现更多商品","and prepare for your next order.":"为下一次订单做好准备。","INDEPENDENT GUIDE · NOT OPERATED BY JOYAGOO · PREVIEW VERSION":"独立指南 · 非 JOYAGOO 运营 · 预览版"});
 Object.assign(translations.de,{"FindSpreadsheet snapshot: 19 Oct 2026. Listings shown have a Weidian ID and open on Joyagoo. USD prices are estimates converted from the snapshot at 1 USD = 6.6753 CNY (6 Nov 2026); confirm the current price and availability on Joyagoo. QC photos are not included.":"FindSpreadsheet-Stand vom 19. Oktober 2026. Die angezeigten Artikel haben eine Weidian-ID und öffnen sich bei Joyagoo. USD-Preise sind Schätzungen zum Kurs 1 USD = 6,6753 CNY (6. November 2026); prüfe Preis und Verfügbarkeit bei Joyagoo. QC-Fotos sind nicht enthalten.","Product, category or item ID":"Produkt, Kategorie oder Artikel-ID","Loading products…":"Produkte werden geladen…","No matching products in this snapshot.":"Keine passenden Produkte in diesem Datenstand.","Unable to load the catalogue. Please try again.":"Der Katalog konnte nicht geladen werden. Bitte erneut versuchen.","Product not found in this catalogue snapshot.":"Produkt in diesem Datenstand nicht gefunden.","QC photos are not included in this catalogue snapshot. Check your own order on Joyagoo.":"Dieser Datenstand enthält keine QC-Fotos. Prüfe deine eigene Bestellung bei Joyagoo.","Weidian item ID:":"Weidian-Artikel-ID:","Not available":"Nicht verfügbar","View source product":"Originalprodukt ansehen","Categories":"Kategorien","Guides":"Ratgeber","How to Buy":"So kaufst du","FAQ":"FAQ","A considered way to discover products":"Produkte bewusst entdecken","and prepare for your next order.":"und die nächste Bestellung vorbereiten.","INDEPENDENT GUIDE · NOT OPERATED BY JOYAGOO · PREVIEW VERSION":"UNABHÄNGIGER LEITFADEN · NICHT VON JOYAGOO BETRIEBEN · VORSCHAU"});
 Object.assign(translations.fr,{"FindSpreadsheet snapshot: 19 Oct 2026. Listings shown have a Weidian ID and open on Joyagoo. USD prices are estimates converted from the snapshot at 1 USD = 6.6753 CNY (6 Nov 2026); confirm the current price and availability on Joyagoo. QC photos are not included.":"Instantané FindSpreadsheet du 19 octobre 2026. Les articles affichés ont un identifiant Weidian et s’ouvrent sur Joyagoo. Les prix USD sont estimés au taux de 1 USD = 6,6753 CNY (6 novembre 2026) ; vérifiez prix et disponibilité sur Joyagoo. Les photos QC ne sont pas incluses.","Product, category or item ID":"Produit, catégorie ou identifiant","Loading products…":"Chargement des produits…","No matching products in this snapshot.":"Aucun produit correspondant dans cet instantané.","Unable to load the catalogue. Please try again.":"Impossible de charger le catalogue. Réessayez.","Product not found in this catalogue snapshot.":"Produit introuvable dans cet instantané.","QC photos are not included in this catalogue snapshot. Check your own order on Joyagoo.":"Cet instantané ne contient pas de photos QC. Consultez votre propre commande sur Joyagoo.","Weidian item ID:":"Identifiant Weidian :","Not available":"Indisponible","View source product":"Voir le produit source","Categories":"Catégories","Guides":"Guides","How to Buy":"Comment acheter","FAQ":"FAQ","A considered way to discover products":"Une sélection réfléchie de produits","and prepare for your next order.":"pour préparer votre prochaine commande.","INDEPENDENT GUIDE · NOT OPERATED BY JOYAGOO · PREVIEW VERSION":"GUIDE INDÉPENDANT · NON GÉRÉ PAR JOYAGOO · APERÇU"});
