 Object.assign(translations.zh,{"Compare the actual and dimensional weight, shipping route, restrictions and expected delivery range. Review taxes, destination rules and the final quote for your own parcel.":"比较实际重量、体积重量、运输线路、限制条件和预计送达时间。检查目的地的税费、规定，以及你自己的包裹最终报价。","Compare the item type, colour, size and visible details with your order. Look for mismatched options, missing components or damage, and request an additional angle if evidence is unclear. A photo is not proof of authenticity, fit or long-term performance.":"将商品类型、颜色、尺码和可见细节与订单核对。检查选项是否有误、是否缺少配件或存在损坏；如照片不清楚，可要求补拍其他角度。照片不能证明真伪、合身程度或长期使用表现。","Explore clear, useful buying topics and return for future updates. Availability, rules, fees and shipping routes can change, so verify current details on Joyagoo.":"浏览实用的购买主题，并随时回来查看更新。商品供应、规则、费用及运输线路可能变化，请在 Joyagoo 核实当前信息。","Start broad, narrow by item type and measurements, and retain the original product URL and marketplace ID so that you can verify the correct listing later.":"先广泛浏览，再按商品类型和尺寸缩小范围，并保留原商品链接和平台编号，以便日后核实正确的商品页面。","Research and practical updates":"调研与实用更新","How to review QC photos":"如何检查 QC 照片","Planning a parcel":"如何规划包裹","Choosing a category":"如何选择类别","Joyagoo Spreadsheet Updates":"Joyagoo 电子表格更新"});
